<% content_for :title, "Shipping Policy — TrustShip" %>

<div class="print:bg-white">
  <p class="mb-6">
    <%= link_to "← Back to home", root_path, class: "text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500" %>
  </p>

  <header class="border-b border-gray-200 pb-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-gray-500">Last updated: May 2026</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-4 text-sm print:hidden" aria-label="Table of contents">
    <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">On this page</p>
    <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-gray-700">
      <li><a href="#ship-1" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Shipping partner</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ship-2" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Serviceable areas</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ship-3" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Shipping modes</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ship-4" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Tracking</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ship-5" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">COD orders</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ship-6" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Failed deliveries & RTO</a></li>
      <li><a href="#ship-7" class="text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500">Shipping charges</a></li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <div class="mt-10 space-y-10">
    <section id="ship-1">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Shipping partner</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        TrustShip does not operate courier services directly. Sellers ship orders using their preferred logistics providers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="ship-2">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">2. Serviceable areas</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Coverage depends on the courier selected by the seller</li>
        <li>Address quality checks help flag risky or unclear delivery addresses</li>
        <li>Sellers are responsible for confirming final serviceability before shipping</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="ship-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">3. Shipping modes</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Surface shipping (default)</li>
        <li>Delivery typically within 3–7 business days</li>
        <li>Express options may be available depending on courier availability</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="ship-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">4. Tracking</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Tracking depends on the courier used by the seller</li>
        <li>TrustShip focuses on order capture and verification, not live courier tracking</li>
        <li>Sellers should share courier tracking details directly with buyers</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="ship-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">5. COD orders</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>COD collection is handled by the courier selected by the seller</li>
        <li>Remittance timelines follow the seller-courier agreement</li>
        <li>COD policies depend on the logistics provider in use</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="ship-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">6. Failed deliveries & RTO</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Up to three delivery attempts before RTO</li>
        <li>Seller is notified when an order returns (RTO)</li>
        <li>Return shipping charges depend on courier terms</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="ship-7">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">7. Shipping charges</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Shipping charges are separate from TrustShip fees</li>
        <li>They are charged by the seller&apos;s chosen courier</li>
        <li>Rates depend on weight, dimensions, and destination</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
